        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
            "facets": [
              {
                "features": [
                  {
                    "$type": "pub.leaflet.richtext.facet#code"
                  }
                ],
                "index": {
                  "byteEnd": 35,
                  "byteStart": 25
                }
              }
            ],
            "plaintext": "I'm very excited for the 0.0.6-rc.3 of beet, now available."
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
            "facets": [
              {
                "features": [
                  {
                    "$type": "pub.leaflet.richtext.facet#link",
                    "uri": "https://youtu.be/JeXOajFv8Dk"
                  }
                ],
                "index": {
                  "byteEnd": 35,
                  "byteStart": 11
                }
              }
            ],
            "plaintext": "In March I spoke at the bevy meetup about unifying structural representations (games, dom trees, behavior etc), since then I've only become more certain this is how I want to develop applications. One language (rust), one paradigm (bevy ecs) across the entire stack."
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
            "plaintext": "The biggest missing piece of this picture is the DOM so this has been my focus. I got the first implementation wrong though, thinking it would be overkill to use bevy for the web parser etc."
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.code",
            "language": "js",
            "plaintext": "// bevy as a feature\nbeet\n├── html\n└── bevy"
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
            "facets": [
              {
                "features": [
                  {
                    "$type": "pub.leaflet.richtext.facet#link",
                    "uri": "https://discord.com/channels/691052431525675048/811674847767167027/1371290138306678795"
                  }
                ],
                "index": {
                  "byteEnd": 96,
                  "byteStart": 73
                }
              }
            ],
            "plaintext": "It was working but it was not beautiful and much less maintainable, so I threw down the gauntlet and made the call to rewrite the entire dom parsing system in bevy."
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.code",
            "language": "js",
            "plaintext": "// bevy as a foundation\nbevy\n└── beet\n    └── html"
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
            "plaintext": "And that brings us to today, the first RC for the fullstack bevy experience with a growing list of features:"
          }
        },
        {
          "$type": "pub.leaflet.pages.linearDocument#block",
          "block": {
            "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.unorderedList",
            "children": [
              {
                "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.unorderedList#listItem",
                "content": {
                  "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.text",
                  "plaintext": "File based routes"
                }
              },
              {
                "$type": "pub.leaflet.blocks.unorderedList#listItem",
